---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title={`隱私權政策 | 10Best Living`} description={`10Best Living privacy policy. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information in compliance with GDPR and CCPA.`} path={`/privacy-policy`}>
  <div class="bg-card">
    <div class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-gradient-to-br from-cream via-cream-dark to-cream">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-primary mb-6 leading-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
      <div class="prose-content text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary" data-aos="fade-up">
<h2 id="sec-1">最後更新</h2>
<p>本隱私權政策最後更新於2026年10月1日。</p>

<h2 id="sec-2">引言</h2>
<p>10Best Living ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website 10bestliving.com.</p>

<h2 id="sec-3">我們收集的數據</h2>
<h3>個人信息</h3>
<ul>
<li>姓名和電子郵件地址（當您訂閱我們的電子報或聯繫我們時）</li>
<li>瀏覽器類型和版本</li>
<li>IP地址和大致地理位置</li>
<li>操作系統和設備信息</li>
<li>訪問的頁面和在網站上花費的時間</li>
<li>來源URL和搜索詞</li>
</ul>
<h3>Cookie和追蹤</h3>
<p>We use cookies, web beacons, and similar tracking technologies to enhance your experience, analyze site usage, and serve relevant content. You can control cookie settings through your browser preferences.</p>

<h2 id="sec-4">我們如何使用您的信息</h2>
<ul>
<li>運營和維護本網站</li>
<li>發送電子報和產品推薦（經您的同意）</li>
<li>分析網站流量並改進內容</li>
<li>回應您的評論和問題</li>
<li>透過聯盟合作夥伴展示相關廣告</li>
<li>遵守法律義務</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="sec-5">第三方服務</h2>
<p>We use the following third-party services that may collect information about you:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> For website traffic analysis</li>
<li><strong>Amazon Associates:</strong> For affiliate linking and commission tracking</li>
<li><strong>Mailchimp:</strong> For newsletter delivery and management</li>
<li><strong>Cloudflare:</strong> For website security and performance</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="sec-6">您的權利（GDPR與CCPA）</h2>
<p>Under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), you have the right to:</p>
<ul>
<li>查閱您的個人資料</li>
<li>要求更正不準確的數據</li>
<li>要求刪除您的數據</li>
<li>選擇退出數據出售（如適用的話）</li>
<li>隨時撤回同意</li>
</ul>
<p>To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@10bestliving.com" class="text-gold">privacy@10bestliving.com</a>.</p>

<h2 id="sec-7">數據保留</h2>
<p>We retain your personal information only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy. Newsletter subscribers' data is retained until they unsubscribe. Analytics data is retained for 26 months.</p>

<h2 id="sec-8">兒童隱私</h2>
<p>Our website is not intended for children 16歲以上的年齡. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 16.</p>

<h2 id="sec-9">本政策變更</h2>
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. We will notify you of significant changes by posting a notice on our website.</p>

<h2 id="sec-10">Contact</h2>
<p>有關隱私問題的查詢，請聯繫 <a href="mailto:privacy@10bestliving.com" class="text-gold">privacy@10bestliving.com</a>.</p>
</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>


